<title>FRANCE: Air Liquide H1 net attrib up 1.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Air Liquide H1 net attrib up 1.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable		  1,342  vs    1,320</p>
<p>Note - Air Liquide gave the results in a statement. It said net attributable profit was up 1.7 percent and represented 8.1 percent of sales.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
